  "prompt": "How much net revenue shipped to each country in the first quarter of 2025, side by side in one row? Use the sales table and count only order lines with an order_date from 2025-01-01 to 2025-03-31, both days included. Return three columns, in this order: nl_revenue_eur, be_revenue_eur and lu_revenue_eur, the sum of net_revenue_eur over the lines whose country_code is 'NL', 'BE' and 'LU'. Lines with a missing net_revenue_eur add nothing. Return one row. Do not round. Any row order is fine.",
